{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_07_beg","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_07","title":"背叛","storyCode":"MB-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b98848b9503bcb202c7d0a8e0afe4b914b5119a541ef5d7a78cbf9cd6e9faa6d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這下終於到實行越獄的環節了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺整個流程雖然略過了一些事情，但還是比我想像的要複雜許多呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，我都有些睏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我去給大家泡一杯咖啡吧~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"還差一點就結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不過接下來發生的事我也差不多猜到啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"一切準備就緒，只等實行越獄的那一天到來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在實行的那一天，有一個人卻忽然失蹤了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"他們最終決定在監獄停靠在紐萊堡市期間的某一次進入C區清掃的機會進行越獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在那一天約定的時間，羅賓卻沒有出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他們不知道，他們的計畫早已被在暗處的傑斯頓完全掌握了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"而羅賓，早已經在他們的必經之路上等待著他們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然場面有點混亂，但是姑且跟你確認一下我們的計畫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我們像現在這樣，趁打掃囚房的機會進來配合你放倒囚犯和獄警......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我們兩個趁著監控那邊的獄警還沒來得及反應，直接前往頂層啟動塔的下沉，然後讓監獄斷電。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"杜瑪已經在地下等著了，只要和她會合，然後一起進入早就挖好的地道裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"最後換上米娜幫我們偷來的工作人員的服裝出去就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直很懷疑，真的有適合我體格的工作人員服裝嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"放心放心，杜瑪特意幫你重新縫製過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"一件不夠那就用兩件拼起來嘛，看起來超大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"記得感謝她哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"再！見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很興奮，卡夫卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，越獄這麼好玩的事情，我當然要興奮了!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，怎麼沒看到羅賓小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"這次清掃的都是老面孔，就不用我多說了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"是~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，要是我們之中又有要刺殺安東尼老大的怎麼辦啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你傻的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為剛才的搜身是幹嘛的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不信你們空著手能幹得過安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我看你很想和安東尼先生過過招啊，要打的話喊我一聲，我來給你助助威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"滾，沒跟你說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼回事，羅賓怎麼沒來？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，A區的大哥，羅賓人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"B區的別跟我說話......哦，是卡夫卡啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊，剛才就沒找到她，我就是頂替她來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，少廢話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"A區的跟他，B區的跟我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，沒有時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"羅賓，抱歉了啊，要怪只能怪你自己這麼緊要的關頭不在了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......事到如今，也沒有回頭的路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"以後還能遇到她的話再向她道歉吧，走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是主控室了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，灰塵好多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"當心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"羅賓？！為什麼你會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我有備份的卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"備份？你什麼時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"退後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們趕時間，現在沒有說話的時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"速戰速決吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_108_silent","aliases":["赫默"]},{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡","獄警"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["梅爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["繆爾賽思"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["安東尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["羅賓"]}]}
